    "description": "<p>You make your attack so that it strikes at an odd angle. Make a ranged Taijutsu Attack against a creature in range with a +1 bonus to its critical threat range. On a hit you deal your [Weapons damage] + 3d8</p>\n<p>Chain 1: If you score a critical hit, the affected creature gains 2 ranks of Bleeding.            At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the bonus to critical threat range to +2.</p>",
